From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alejandro Garcia <skipper.pelygro@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:27:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Input: ft3658 - sleep instead of busy-waiting after each
 transfer

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Alejandro Garcia <skipper.pelygro@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_ft3658.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_ft3658.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_ft3658.c
index 61fc50514..17bdeb15c 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_ft3658.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_ft3658.c
@@ -111,7 +111,7 @@ static int ft3658_read(struct ft3658 *ts, u8 addr, u8 *data, size_t len)
 	xfer.len = xfer_len;
 
 	ret = spi_sync_transfer(ts->spi, &xfer, 1);
-	udelay(FT3658_CS_HIGH_US);
+	fsleep(FT3658_CS_HIGH_US);
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
